    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> is :"
